/E (Why a list: readings are ordered by date, accessed by position \(O\(1\)\), sliced easily and only appended to. Costs: append O\(1\) amortised; insert\(i,x\) O\(n\) \(shifts the tail\); pop\(\) O\(1\) from the end, pop\(i\) O\(n\);)
